# 批判：函数返回嵌套函数赋 fn_callable 类型——修复后编译期拦截（BOUNDARY-NESTED-FUNC-1 核销）
# doc: docs/syntax/05_functions.md
# expect-class: PASS
# expect-code: SEM_TYPE_MISMATCH
# expect-exit: nonzero
func outer() -> fn_callable[int]:
    func inner() -> int:
        return 42
    return inner
fn_callable[int] g = outer()
print(g())
